{"4389980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "10 Hours Before Sunrise", "steam_appid": 4389980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/10d25262caf3d9a41fcdfb44f257ccfe.apng?t=1784661240\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/10d25262caf3d9a41fcdfb44f257ccfe.poster.avif?t=1784661240\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to forget a mistake from his past, Samuel isolates himself in a house deep within a remote forest. What should have been a refuge turns into a living nightmare — and something in that house does not want him to see the sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/6296014c8dcaa3568069bd8b554b0132.poster.avif?t=1784661240\" width=704 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/6296014c8dcaa3568069bd8b554b0132.webm?t=1784661240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Hours Before Sunrise</strong> is a brutal boomer shooter inspired by 8-bit games and the best of ‘80s trash horror. Face grotesque creatures, master a destructive arsenal, and fight to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/452db74cdcfff5989b9456e6413ab852.poster.avif?t=1784661240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/452db74cdcfff5989b9456e6413ab852.webm?t=1784661240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/452db74cdcfff5989b9456e6413ab852.mp4?t=1784661240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pixel art designed to evoke nostalgia, reminiscent of the classics that marked generations in the 80s and 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/f49a59787aa5c49fbdd027365a20ac6a.poster.avif?t=1784661240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/f49a59787aa5c49fbdd027365a20ac6a.webm?t=1784661240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/f49a59787aa5c49fbdd027365a20ac6a.mp4?t=1784661240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hand-drawn rotoscopic animations, bringing more natural movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/5fa17a5f05f42d0b35ca7f9795359df3.poster.avif?t=1784661240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/5fa17a5f05f42d0b35ca7f9795359df3.webm?t=1784661240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/5fa17a5f05f42d0b35ca7f9795359df3.mp4?t=1784661240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Overwhelming heavy metal soundtrack, raising the adrenaline at every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/b50b88c94fe76f5f532783c008b42d8f.poster.avif?t=1784661240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/b50b88c94fe76f5f532783c008b42d8f.webm?t=1784661240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/b50b88c94fe76f5f532783c008b42d8f.mp4?t=1784661240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fast, violent, and chaotic combat, where every second demands sharp reflexes and immediate decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/3f347f73c32e0b6571b89efb01303505.poster.avif?t=1784661240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/3f347f73c32e0b6571b89efb01303505.webm?t=1784661240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/3f347f73c32e0b6571b89efb01303505.mp4?t=1784661240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Short, intense, and highly replayable experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/10d25262caf3d9a41fcdfb44f257ccfe.apng?t=1784661240\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4389980/extras/10d25262caf3d9a41fcdfb44f257ccfe.poster.avif?t=1784661240\" clas